"output on the ``results`` variable. It's important to understand that the"
" result type indicates the format of the Task output |morpheus| should "
"expect. |morpheus| will parse that output into a Groovy map which can be "
"retrieved and further parsed by resolving the ``results`` variable. If "
"the RESULT TYPE is incorrectly set, |morpheus| may not be able to store "
"the Task results correctly. Jump to the section on `Script Config "
"Examples "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/library/automation/tasks/taskResults.html"
"#results-types>`_ to see how script results are processed in various "
"example cases."
msgstr ""
"In script type tasks, if a RESULT TYPE is set, |morpheus| will store the "
"output on the ``results`` variable. It's important to understand that the"
" result type indicates the format of the Tarea output |morpheus| should "
"expect. |morpheus| will parse that output into a Groovy map which puede "
"ser retrieved and further parsed by resolving the ``results`` variable. "
"If the RESULT TYPE is incorrectly set, |morpheus| may not be able to "
"store the Tarea results correctly. Jump to the section on `Script Config "
"Examples "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/library/automation/tasks/taskResults.html"
"#results-types>`_ to see how script results are processed in various "
"example cases."

