#: ../../library/automation/execute_scheduling.rst:2
msgid "Execute Scheduling"
msgstr "Programación de ejecución"

#: ../../library/automation/execute_scheduling.rst:4
msgid ""
"Execute Scheduling creates time schedules for Jobs, including Task, "
"Workflow and Backup Jobs. Jobs, which are discussed in greater detail in "
"`another section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/4.2.0/provisioning/jobs/jobs.html#jobs>`_"
" of |morpheus| docs, combine either a Task or Workflow with an Execute "
"Schedule to run the selected Task or Workflow at the needed time. Backup "
"Jobs are a special type of Job configured in the Backups section which "
"also use Execute Schedules to time backup runs as needed."
msgstr ""
"Execute Scheduling creates time schedules para Jobs, including Tarea, "
"Flujo de trabajo y Backup Jobs. Jobs, el/la cual son discussed en greater"
" detail en `another section "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/4.2.0/provisioning/jobs/jobs.html#jobs>`_"
" de |morpheus| docs, combine either un/una Tarea o Flujo de trabajo con "
"un/una Programación de ejecución a run el/la seleccionado/seleccionada "
"Tarea o Flujo de trabajo en el/la needed time. Backup Jobs son un/una "
"special type de Job configurado/configurada en el/la Backups section "
"el/la cual también use Programaciones de ejecución a time backup runs "
"como needed."

#: ../../library/automation/execute_scheduling.rst:6
msgid ""
"Schedules use CRON expressions, such as ``0 23 * * 2`` equalling "
"``Executes every week on Tuesday at 23:00``. CRON expressions can easily "
"be created by clicking the corresponding translation in the create or "
"edit Execution Schedule modal below the Schedule field and selecting a "
"new value."
msgstr ""
"Schedules use CRON expressions, such como ``0 23 * * 2`` equalling "
"``Executes cada week en Tuesday en 23:00``. CRON expressions puede/n "
"easily be creado/creada por clicking el/la corresponding translation en "
"el/la create o edit Programación de ejecución modal abajo el/la Schedule "
"field y selecting un/una nuevo/nueva value."

#: ../../library/automation/execute_scheduling.rst:8
msgid ""
"Execute Schedules CRON expressions should not include seconds or years. "
"The days of the week should be numbered 1-7, beginning with Monday and "
"ending with Sunday. SUN-SAT notation may also be used. For more on "
"writing CRON expressions, many guides are hosted on the Internet "
"including `this one "
"<https://docs.oracle.com/cd/E12058_01/doc/doc.1014/e12030/cron_expressions.htm>`_."
" |morpheus| execution schedules support most cron syntax but certain more"
" complex expressions may fail to evaluate and the execute schedule will "
"not save. Additionally, some complex expressions may save and work "
"correctly while the friendly written evaluation below the SCHEDULE field "
"is not interpreted correctly. This is due to an issue with the underlying"
" library used to build this feature and cannot easily be resolved at this"
" time."
msgstr ""
"Programaciones de ejecución CRON expressions debería/n ningún include "
"seconds o years. El/La days de el/la week debería/n be numbered 1-7, "
"beginning con Monday y ending con Sunday. SUN-SAT notation puede/n "
"también be used. For más en writing CRON expressions, muchos/muchas "
"guides son hosted en el/la Internet including `this one "
"<https://docs.oracle.com/cd/E12058_01/doc/doc.1014/e12030/cron_expressions.htm>`_."
" |morpheus| execution schedules support la mayoría de cron syntax but "
"certain más complex expressions puede/n fail a evaluate y el/la execute "
"schedule será/n ningún save. Additionally, algunos/algunas complex "
"expressions puede/n save y work correctly mientras el/la friendly written"
" evaluation abajo el/la SCHEDULE field es ningún interpreted correctly. "
"Este/Esta es due a un/una issue con el/la underlying library "
"utilizado/utilizada a build este/esta feature y ningún puede/n easily be "
"resolved en este/esta time."

